Description: block readiness on behind-base, missing review and branch protection
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: no

After the checks passed the only gates left were closed, draft and
changes-requested. A pull request whose base requires an up-to-date head, one
that still owes a required review, and one GitHub leaves BLOCKED under some other
branch protection rule all produced a ready verdict, and the merge then failed
for a reason the watcher had already declared clear. Those three gates now block
a ready verdict, and behind-base is reported ahead of a required review because
updating the branch restarts the checks and can dismiss the approval.

